<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px',
  height: '720px',
  background: '#0A0F1E',
  padding: '40px 64px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  <Text style={{
    fontSize: 34,
    fontWeight: 'bold',
    color: '#F8FAFC',
    marginBottom: 28,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif',
  }}>
    个人空间 · 一屏聚合全部学习事务
  </Text>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    gap: 32,
    flex: 1,
    alignItems: 'stretch',
  }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 360,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      gap: 20,
    }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
        <Box style={{
          width: 48,
          height: 48,
          borderRadius: 12,
          background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #2563EB 100%)',
          justifyContent: 'center',
          alignItems: 'center',
        }}>
          <FAIcon name='home' style={{ fill: '#F8FAFC', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>统一入口</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C7D0E0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        将「我的作业、成绩历史、薄弱知识点、错题本」整合到导航最左侧，学生无需在不同页面间跳转。
      </Text>
      {[
        'Tab 按钮等宽放大，状态一目了然',
        '我的作业按 DDL 由近到远排序',
        '24 小时内截止自动进入红色紧急区',
        '实时倒计时提醒，杜绝遗漏',
      ].map((t, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 10 }}>
          <FAIcon name='check-circle' style={{ fill: '#D4AF37', width: 18, height: 18, marginTop: 4 }} />
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C7D0E0', flex: 1 }}>{t}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      background: '#131C33',
      borderRadius: 20,
      padding: 12,
      justifyContent: 'center',
      alignItems: 'center',
      border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.2)',
    }}>
      <Image
        src="assets/01_space_assignments.png"
        style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 12 }}
      />
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    justifyContent: 'space-between',
    marginTop: 24,
  }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>金瑞升学 · 金鹰系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>05 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
